# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SocialAI -- environment variable template.
#
# Copy this file to .env.development.local (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# For production on AWS Amplify, set the same names in the Amplify console
# (App settings > Environment variables) -- DO NOT commit the real values.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Authentication mode (Lesson 39):
#   mock - accept token "123" only while running npm start
#   real - ask the backend to validate the JWT signature and expiration
REACT_APP_AUTH_MODE=real

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Image generation provider (Lesson 44).
#
# The app auto-selects the right provider -- you do NOT need to set anything
# for the free path to work:
#
#   * No REACT_APP_OPENAI_KEY below      -> Pollinations.ai (free, no signup,
#                                            FLUX Apache 2.0 model, AWS-reachable).
#                                            Anonymous tier is rate-limited to
#                                            roughly one request every 15 s;
#                                            a free account removes the limit
#                                            and the watermark.
#
#   * REACT_APP_OPENAI_KEY is set        -> OpenAI gpt-image-2 is tried first.
#                                            If the call fails (zero credits,
#                                            model offline, etc.) the app
#                                            silently falls back to Pollinations.
#
# To FORCE a specific provider (handy for debugging / cost comparisons):
#   REACT_APP_IMAGE_PROVIDER=pollinations   # ignore OpenAI, always use free
#   REACT_APP_IMAGE_PROVIDER=openai        # require OpenAI (error if no key)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Paste a real key here ONLY in .env.development.local or in Amplify's
# environment variables panel. Never commit the actual file.
# REACT_APP_OPENAI_KEY=

# REACT_APP_IMAGE_PROVIDER=pollinations